# composed, posed by the evaluation's 4x4, mounted shaded + outlined, cached
# against a pose change and re-read against a file change; plus path
# resolution, the missing-file report, a units= change being different
# geometry that the record reports (so a cache can key on it), the shared
# feature-edge extractor, reference-aware auto-framing, and a .gltf whose
# external buffer is rewritten under an untouched manifest being re-read.
test_reference_meshes.gd assertions=42

# The GUI "Import mesh…" action: the button and the scene-declared picker
